OL,3,GNEWSABoxing gym vows to 'keep fighting'
OL,4,Aafter break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head coach of a boxing gym says he
OL,7,Fvows to "keep fighting" on after
OL,8,F#2,000-worth of gym equipment was
OL,9,Fstolen.
OL,11,FWiltshire Police said a number of free
OL,12,Fweights and power tools had been taken
OL,13,Ffrom War Boxing Academy on Silver
OL,14,FStreet in Warminster on 7 October.
OL,16,FChris Dax said it was hard "to put into
OL,17,Fwords how frustrating and upsetting"
OL,18,Fthe situation had been.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
