OL,3,GNEWSABoxing gym vows to 'keep fighting'
OL,4,Aafter break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are community run, the membership
OL,7,Ffees cover the rent and expenses of the
OL,8,Fgym, there's very little in the pot so
OL,9,Fto speak. This is probably going to set
OL,10,Fus back months," he added.
